{"id":"einmal","lemma":"einmal","pos":"adv","rank":206,"glosses":["once, one time (one and only one time)","once (formerly; during some period in the past)","sometime (at an indefinite but stated time in the past or future)"],"ipa":"/ˈaɪ̯nmaːl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/75/De-einmal.ogg/De-einmal.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe ihn einmal getroffen.","en":"I met him once.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/177719","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"hit, struck, met"}]},{"text":"Willst du es einmal anfassen?","en":"Do you want to touch it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759787","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to touch"}]},{"text":"Du kannst es nur einmal benutzen.","en":"You can only use it once.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759796","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"only"},null,{"g":"to make use"}]},{"text":"Ich war einmal schön.","en":"I was beautiful once.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"well, beautifully"}]},{"text":"Ich habe es nur einmal benutzt.","en":"I've only used it once.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758419","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"only"},null,{"g":"to make use","l":"benutzen"}]}]}